OL,3,GNEWSAKing penguin chick hatches in UK
OL,4,Aheatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife park is celebrating the
OL,7,Fhatching of the first king penguin
OL,8,Fchick in the UK since 2014.
OL,10,FThe chick weighed 188g (6.6oz) when it
OL,11,Fhatched and is being hand-reared by
OL,12,Fkeepers at Birdland Park and Gardens in
OL,13,FGloucestershire, who previously had to
OL,14,Fmove the egg to an incubator for safety
OL,15,Freasons.
OL,17,FThe egg belongs to parents French and
OL,18,FFrank, with staff at the zoo saying the
OL,19,Fchick has already overcome several
OL,20,Fobstacles to survive - including the
OL,21,Fheat.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
