OL,3,GNEWSAKing penguin chick hatches in UK
OL,4,Aheatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While everyone else has been talking
OL,7,Fabout how to keep cool this summer,
OL,8,Fwe've spent the past few weeks
OL,9,Fconcentrating on one very important
OL,10,Flittle penguin," said Alistair Keen,
OL,11,Fhead of living collection at the park.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
